<title>UK: Mexico sets 500 billion lire 20-year bond. [Corrected 9:49 gmt]</title>
<headline>Mexico sets 500 billion lire 20-year bond. [Corrected 9:49 gmt]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MEXICO</p>
<p> AMT    500 BLN LIRE  COUPON     11.00     MATURITY    08.MAY.17</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100	 PAY DATE    08.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.70	REOFFER    100	 SPREAD	=</p>
<p>(Corrects full fees from &quot;0.75&quot;)</p>
<p> MOODY	BA2	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BB	  DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMITS</p>
<p>US/UK/IT/MX</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  MEXICO    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.20	SELL CONC  0.50	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF GLOBAL EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
